# books.pdl - extra event sources for blueprintz that are not a game's @.apps/<app>/events/ (they have no verbs.pdl). Each row is one entry of the Games menu.
#   BOOK | id | kind | folder relative to the target house
#   kind single : the folder itself holds event_pkg/pages (one event, e.g. the book-stack reader)
#   kind events : the folder holds event folders, each with event_pkg/pages (like a game's events/)
# id: letters, digits, _ - . only. Loaded with the Games menu row; edits go through the same ops as any other loaded event.
BOOK | reader | single | _.monads/_.book-stack/pieces/reader
